# graphify input scoping — strict whitelist (default-deny).
#
# Keep ONLY the architecture surface: src/, packages/, docs/, and the three
# root guides (AGENTS.md, CONTEXT.md, MEMORY.md). Everything else — tests,
# scratch, tooling (.husky/.fork-skills/scripts/.github), build configs
# (package.json, manifest.json, esbuild/eslint/jest/tsconfig), README,
# CHANGELOG, locale JSON, assets — is excluded from the graph.
#
# gitignore syntax (last-match-wins). graphify reads this AND .gitignore; this
# only excludes MORE (a ! here cannot re-include a .gitignore-excluded file).
# Honored by detect() and the post-commit/post-checkout hook rebuild.
#
# Why !/dir AND !/dir/* (not !/dir/): graphify matches with fnmatch, where *
# crosses "/". So /* excludes every path at every depth; !/dir re-includes the
# directory entry (satisfying the parent-exclusion rule) and !/dir/* re-includes
# its full contents. A bare !/dir/ would only match the directory entry itself
# and leave its contents excluded.

/*
!/src
!/src/*
!/packages
!/packages/*
!/docs
!/docs/*
!/AGENTS.md
!/CONTEXT.md
!/MEMORY.md
